  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Puig de S. Andreu, Ullastret</p>\r\n<p>Cato's victory near Emporion in 195 BCE (see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://latin.packhum.org/loc/914/1/184/1082-1088#1177\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Livy 34.14-15</a>) may have been fought nearby.\u00a0 See Keay 1988, 31; Knapp 1980, 33.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient settlement, lying on a hill east of the modern village of Ullastret in Catalonia.",
